+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Orders currently support no discounts: coupons can be created and read through the admin
+endpoints, but there is no way for a customer to actually use one on an order. The order
+schema already carries `discount_cents`, `final_amount_cents` and `coupon_code`, and the
+database already has a `coupon_redemptions` table, so the only missing piece is the
+redemption flow itself.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` with body `{ "couponCode": "..." }`. It applies a
+  coupon to a pending order and returns the updated order.
+- Support both coupon types: `FIXED` (a cents amount off) and `PERCENT` (a percentage off,
+  optionally capped by `max_discount_cents`).
+- Enforce coupon eligibility: coupon exists, is `ACTIVE`, is inside its validity window,
+  the order subtotal meets `min_amount_cents`, and the coupon's `usage_limit` is not
+  exhausted.
+- Only `PENDING` orders can receive a coupon; orders without a coupon have no discount.
+- Record each successful application in `coupon_redemptions` and increment the coupon's
+  `used_count`.
+- Reject a second application to an order that already has a coupon (no stacking).
+- The discount never exceeds the order amount, so `final_amount_cents >= 0`.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+- `coupon-redemption`: applying a coupon to an order - eligibility rules, discount
+  calculation for fixed and percent coupons, order amount updates, and redemption
+  bookkeeping (usage counting and redemption records).
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+<!-- None: no existing capability has spec-level requirements yet. -->
+
+## Impact
+
+- New route: `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` (`src/routes/orders.ts`).
+- `OrderService` gains the apply-coupon use case and a dependency on coupon lookup and
+  redemption recording (`src/services/orderService.ts`, `src/app.ts`).
+- `OrderRepository` gains an update that writes `discount_cents`, `final_amount_cents` and
+  `coupon_code` (`src/repositories/orderRepository.ts`).
+- `CouponRepository` gains `used_count` incrementing (`src/repositories/couponRepository.ts`)
+  and a new redemption repository is added for `coupon_redemptions`.
+- No schema change: `orders` and `coupon_redemptions` already have the needed columns.
+- No new dependencies.
